(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers procurement of distribution transformers and lt cables) Tj T*
(complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART C — DISTRIBUTION TRANSFORMERS) Tj T*
(- Distribution transformers shall comply with IS 1180 \(Part 1\):2014. Transformer rating) Tj T*
(shall be 630 kva, 11/0.433 kV, vector group Dyn11.) Tj T*
(- Transformers shall comply with energy efficiency level 2 of IS 1180 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(- Transformers shall be outdoor type, copper wound, oil immersed with ONAN cooling.) Tj T*
(- The top oil temperature rise shall be limited to 35 ? above an ambient of 50 ?.) Tj T*
(- The tank shall be fabricated from welded mild steel with epoxy paint finish.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(- LT power cables shall be aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured, PVC sheathed,) Tj T*
(1.1 kV grade, complying with IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988. The size of the main feeder cable) Tj T*
(shall be 3.5 core 300 mm2.) Tj T*
(- Maximum continuous conductor temperature of the cables shall be 90 ?.) Tj T*
(- Copper conductor control cables of 2.5 mm2, PVC insulated, 1.1 kV grade shall comply) Tj T*
(with IS 1554 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(- Class 2 stranded conductors complying with IS 8130 shall be used.) Tj T*
(- Cables shall be run in RCC trenches or on perforated trays as per drawings.) Tj T*
(- Double compression glands and crimped lugs shall be used for all cable terminations.) Tj T*
(- The maker's name, size, voltage grade and year of manufacture shall be marked on every) Tj T*
(drum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
